WEBVTT

00:26:28.038 --> 00:26:30.371
you know, the threats of
robotics or whatever.

00:26:30.704 --> 00:26:33.663
If you throw in a human
editor into the mix,

00:26:34.329 --> 00:26:38.579
you could probably imagine something much
sooner. Indeed. Like tomorrow. Yeah.

00:26:38.621 --> 00:26:44.246
So the hybrid the hybrid version where
it's basically a tool assisted TED talk,

00:26:44.413 --> 00:26:46.663
but that it is better than any TED talk

00:26:46.663 --> 00:26:48.996
a human could generate in one
hundred hours or whatever,

00:26:49.454 --> 00:26:53.829
if you can sort of combine human
discretion with A.I. horsepower.

00:26:54.371 --> 00:26:56.246
I suspect that's like our next year

00:26:56.246 --> 00:26:58.913
or two years from now kind of thing
where it's just really quite good.